\u0151forr\u00e1s (pl. Time is a _______ resource that should not be wasted.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>precious<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>precious<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>preciously<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>preciousness<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: precious metals \/ precious stones \/ precious time \/ precious life<\/span><\/p><p>similar: valuable \/ cherished \/ treasured \/ costly<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: worthless \/ cheap \/ common<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-23","reviewed_on":"2026-06-24","due_at":"2026-06-24T08:07:47+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-23T13:13:15+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-23","reviewed_on":"2026-06-23"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"30 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-24T08:23:34+00:00"},{"id":51503,"front":"<p>She tried to _______ the accusations, but the evidence was overwhelming. <em>(tagad \/ visszautas\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p>The government continues to _______ access to information about the incident. <em>(megtagad \/ nem enged\u00e9lyez)<\/em><\/p><p>It&#039;s hard to _______ the fact that climate change is a serious threat. <em>(letagad \/ nem vesz tudom\u00e1sul)<\/em><\/p><p>He couldn&#039;t _______ himself the pleasure of a long, hot bath after the arduous journey. <em>(megvon mag\u00e1t\u00f3l \/ megtagad mag\u00e1t\u00f3l)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">tagad \/ megtagad \/ visszautas\u00edt<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): elismer \/ elf