ong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>null<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>null<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>noon<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>null<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: at noon \/ by noon \/ high noon \/ around noon<\/span><\/p><p>similar: midday \/ twelve o&#039;clock \/ noontime \/ meridian<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: midnight \/ night \/ dawn<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-24","reviewed_on":"2026-06-24","due_at":"2026-06-24T08:02:50+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"new","due_at":null,"interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":null,"reviewed_on":null}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"30 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-24T08:00:18+00:00"},{"id":51502,"front":"<p>The sudden loud noise seemed to _______ his anxiety, making him jump. <em>(kiv\u00e1lt \/ elind\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p>Certain economic policies can _______ a ripple effect across various industries. <em>(okoz \/ el\u0151id\u00e9z)<\/em><\/p><p>For many, the smell of freshly baked bread can _______ nostalgic memories of childhood. <em>(felid\u00e9z \/ esz\u00e9be juttat)<\/em><\/p><p>The detective looked for a specific _______ that would reveal the killer&#039;s motive. <em>(ind\u00edt\u00e9k \/ kiv\u00e1lt\u00f3 ok)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">kiv\u00e1lt \/ elind\u00edt \/ okoz \/ ravasz<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): megakad\u00e1lyoz \/ le\u00e1ll\u00edt \/ megg\u00e1tol<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a reaction = reakci\u00f3t kiv\u00e1lt (pl. His comments might _______ a strong reaction from the audience.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a memory = eml\u00e9ket felid\u00e9z (pl. The old song always seems to _______ a memory of my youth.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ an event = esem\u00e9nyt elind\u00edt\/okoz (pl. The assassination was the _______ that led to the war.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a _______ for change = a v\u00e1ltoz\u00e1s kiv\u00e1lt\u00f3 oka (pl. Economic hardship often acts as a _______ for social change.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>trigger<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>trigger<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>trigger<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: trigger a response \/ trigger an alarm \/ trigger a debate \/ trigger mechanism<\/span><\/p><p>similar: activate \/ initiate \/ provoke \/ cause<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: prevent \/ stop \/ halt<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-24","reviewed_on":"2026-06-24","due_at":"2026-06-24T08:03:11+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"new","due_at":null,"interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":null,"reviewed_on":null}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"30 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-24T07:59:34+00:00"},{"id":51493,"front":"<p>The old branch made a loud _______ as it broke under the weight of the snow. <em>(pattan\u00e1s \/ ropog\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>She tends to _______ at her children when she&#039;s stressed, which she later regrets. <em>(r\u00e1ripakodik \/ lecsattan)<\/em><\/p><p>The photographer managed to _______ a perfect shot of the bird in mid-flight. <em>(elkap \/ lefot\u00f3z)<\/em><\/p><p>With a quick _______ of the fingers, he signaled for the waiter. <em>(csettint\u